# sagitta.pin — the oracle. Shell-sourceable (as pax's `user/pelt.pin`).
#
# C yew is built from this commit of tenseleyFlow/sagitta and is the
# ORACLE for the port: its PTY goldens, script, Fletch, syntax and
# torture suites are run against the wolf binary unchanged
# (tools/oracle, tools/goldens). The pin moves only by a lane that says
# why in its note and in CHANGELOG.md; a golden that disagrees with the
# port is a STOP, never a golden edit (track rule 2).
#
# yw00 (2026-10-19): 9ace98c2 is sagitta's trunk head on the day the
# track opened and the commit the track index measured its line counts
# at ("Fetch history for Valgrind audit", 2026-10-19 12:57 -0400). No
# later commit existed, so there was nothing to choose between.
SAGITTA_REPO=https://github.com/tenseleyFlow/sagitta
SAGITTA_REV=9ace98c2adfeb9d63e7da4bdb4fd6e29ae5c3e4a
